---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { reports } from '../../data/reports';
---
<Layout title="Industry reports / 產業報告 — Kaimau Chang"><Header /><main id="main" class="archive-page"><p class="eyebrow">WRITING & RESEARCH / 研究與作品</p><h1>Industry reports.<br />產業報告</h1>{reports.length ? reports.map(report => <article style="margin: 32px 0"><p class="eyebrow">{report.category}</p><h2 style="font-size:24px;margin:12px 0"><a href={report.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{report.title} ↗</a></h2><p>{report.description}</p></article>) : <><p>Coming soon. This collection will feature my industry reports and technology perspectives as they become available.</p><p>報告即將陸續上架。此專區將收錄我撰寫的產業報告與技術觀點，目前尚未公開作品。</p></>}<a class="button button-dark" href="/#reports">Back to portfolio / 返回作品集 ↗</a></main></Layout>
